# VLC for Android 3.7: the touch tutorials (swipe and tap overlays on the first video,
# audio player and playlist) marked as seen; they need a touchscreen to get past. Its
# welcome pages (onboarding) are marked done too (app_onboarding_done,
# initial_permission_asked), dark theme is on (app_theme 2 = night mode yes), and the
# all files access they would ask for is given, so
# it can find videos and music everywhere, EASYROMS too. The media scan stays at
# VLC's default (on). Its settings are the default shared_prefs, which also mean "has
# run". See ../../README.md, "First-start settings".
package org.videolan.vlc
unless data shared_prefs/org.videolan.vlc_preferences.xml
appop MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE allow
data prefs.xml shared_prefs/org.videolan.vlc_preferences.xml
